{
  "title": "example",
  "created_at": "2026-05-19T18:35:34.834403",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "The word 'example' most commonly refers to a specific instance",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/0_70153881bf08ed58.jpg",
        "url": null,
        "source": "https://www.makemyassignments.com/blog/how-to-integrate-real-life-examples-into-your-academic-writing/"
      },
      "word_start": 0,
      "word_end": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "used to illustrate a general idea, rule, or concept.",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/1_c9ba6dea338549ff.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 10,
      "word_end": 18
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When people say \"for example,\" they are introducing a concrete case",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/2_a361f2b9516a1af4.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 19,
      "word_end": 29
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "that makes an abstract point easier to understand.",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/3_c8502a63f4f1d025.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 30,
      "word_end": 37
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In everyday life, an example might be",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/4_5d36e4c9f4b2c8dd.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 38,
      "word_end": 44
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "a sample math problem in a textbook,",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/5_1b27bbce91cc2644.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 45,
      "word_end": 51
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "a model behavior in a classroom,",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/6_260ec1cc5e5f1596.jpg",
        "url": null,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 52,
      "word_end": 57
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "or a case study in a business meeting.",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/7_b512c30b3413b3f3.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 58,
      "word_end": 65
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The most popular use of the term, however, is in teaching and explanation,",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/8_b67cf2bde7c2b2ce.jpg",
        "url": null,
        "source": "http://clipart-library.com/clipart/yTkrBoz7c.htm"
      },
      "word_start": 66,
      "word_end": 78
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "where an example serves as a bridge between theory and reality.",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/9_07d85472d9600a26.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 79,
      "word_end": 89
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "An interesting fact about the idea of an example is that",
      "media": null,
      "word_start": 90,
      "word_end": 100
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "the ancient Greek philosopher Aristotle considered examples a powerful form of rhetorical proof,",
      "media": {
        "type": "gif",
        "file_path": "media/11_0943d6f6982fa823.gif",
        "url": "https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTIwMjY3YmNlOHltbzlyZmlxMWgwaTkwaGYwMGd0cmdrdHpxazM2eTMzMzVrdzdvMSZlcD12MV9naWZzX3NlYXJjaCZjdD1n/Sd1KRbPEarxWWVwQi7/giphy.gif",
        "source": "Giphy"
      },
      "word_start": 101,
      "word_end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "even more persuasive than logical arguments in some situations",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/12_006d14d4b7ebb612.mp4",
        "url": "https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2025/10/22/311338_small.mp4",
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": "Pixabay"
      },
      "word_start": 114,
      "word_end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "because people connect more easily with stories and specific instances than with abstract reasoning.",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/13_5d8e833d0cdcbf1e.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": "Pixabay"
      },
      "word_start": 123,
      "word_end": 136
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "This is why teachers, speakers, and writers rely on examples",
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "file_path": "media/14_27a86a1ed08a066f.png",
        "url": null,
        "source": "https://pngtree.com/freepng/i-love-you-text-lettering-with-hearts-of-free-vector-and-png_8525791.html"
      },
      "word_start": 137,
      "word_end": 146
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "to make their points stick.",
      "media": null,
      "word_start": 147,
      "word_end": 151
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Without examples, many complex ideas would remain confusing",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/16_9ee0f8d69437dd04.mp4",
        "url": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/37166944/15745203_720_1280_30fps.mp4",
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": "Pexels"
      },
      "word_start": 152,
      "word_end": 159
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "and out of reach for most people.",
      "media": {
        "type": "video",
        "file_path": "media/17_a8776b09ee89fc46.mp4",
        "url": null,
        "start_timestamp": 0.0,
        "source": null
      },
      "word_start": 160,
      "word_end": 166
    }
  ]
}